### ==============================================================================
### GRIEVANCES & CITIZEN COMPLAINT REDRESSAL APIS
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@adminSecretKey = BYK_SUPER_ADMIN_ALIGARH_SECRET_2026

### 1. Submit Public / Member Grievance
POST {{baseUrl}}/grievances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Manish Sharma",
  "email": "manish.sharma@example.com",
  "phone": "9812309876",
  "subject": "Delay in volunteer badge dispatch",
  "message": "I was approved as volunteer last week but have not received my physical badge."
}

### 2. Admin: List Grievances (Filter by pending / in_progress / resolved)
GET {{baseUrl}}/grievances?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}

### 3. Admin: Update Grievance & Mark Resolved
PUT {{baseUrl}}/grievances/GRIEVANCE_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "resolved",
  "resolutionNotes": "Physical badge dispatched via speed post. Tracking ID sent via SMS."
}
